# Everything is LF in the repository and in the working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# githooks/ holds a POSIX shell script and plain-text lists that githooks/pre-push reads line by
# line. Checked out CRLF, `release\r` stops equalling `release` and the branch falls through the
# owner-only list (measured on Taskr 2026-08-05: file present, `git status` clean, guard silently
# off). The hook strips a trailing CR as well; neither half replaces the other.
/githooks/*    text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
